        "purpose": "The ciamJob (kind pipeline) entry for one FoundPipeline: the record's (same repo URL and definition path) or a new one, named SYSTEM-REPO-FILE made unique. The import owns its name as the system shows it (ciamJobName), its CI system (ciamCiSystem), schedules, triggers, runners (ciamRuntime), secret names, environments, and repo URL/path; what the record adds is kept.",
